 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, you are rolling a 6-sided die with 3 orange faces, 2 green faces, and 1 blue face.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516210,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What are the odds in favor of rolling a green face?\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The total number of outcomes: 6.</p>\n<p>The outcomes with a green face: 2.</p>\n<p>The number of outcomes not in the desired event is <span data-math=\"6{\\text{ }}-{\\text{ }}2{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}4\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The odds in favor of rolling a green face are <span data-math=\"2:{\\text{ }}4\"></span> or <span data-math=\"1:2\"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"1{:}2\">1{:}2</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516211,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What are the odds against rolling a blue face?\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The total number of outcomes is 6.</p>\n<p>The number of outcomes with a blue face is 1.</p>\n<p>The number of outcomes not in the desired event is <span data-math=\"6{\\text{ }}-{\\text{ }}1{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}5\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The odds against rolling a blue face are <span data-math=\"5{\\text{ }}:{\\text{ }}1\"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"5{:}1\">5{:}1</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516212,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What are the odds in favor of rolling an orange face?\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The total number of outcomes is 6.</p>\n<p>The number of outcomes with an orange face is 3.</p>\n<p>The number of outcomes not in the desired event is <span data-math=\"6{\\text{ }}-{\\text{ }}3{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}3\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The odds in favor of rolling an orange face is <span data-math=\"3{\\text{ }}:{\\text{ }}3\"></span> or <span data-math=\"1{\\text{ }}:{\\text{ }}1\"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"1{:}1\">1{:}1</span>"
    }
   ],
